---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
permalink: /writing/
description: Essays and research by Jules Lamon.
---
<article class="page">
  <h1>Writing</h1>
  <p class="lede">Essays and research papers, from community college to New College.</p>
  {%- if not collections.posts.length %}<p>No essays have been published yet.</p>{% endif %}
  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <span class="muted">{{ post.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.course %} · {{ post.data.course }}{% endif %}</span>
      {% if post.data.summary %}<p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</article>
